{"message":"Thanks — I can help with that. Because changing account settings requires verifying your identity, I’ll need to confirm 2 of the following pieces of information that are on file: date of birth (MM/DD/YYYY), current email on file, phone number, or address. To get started, please provide either your Rho user ID or your full name (so I can locate your account), then provide any two of those four items. Also tell me the new email address you want set on the account. 

Example response: {"user_id": "abc123"} or {"name": "Alex Example", "DOB": "01/23/1980", "phone": "(555) 123-4567", "new_email": "alex.new@example.com"}.

If you’d rather speak with a human instead, let me know and I can transfer you."}
